 "notes": "Game emulator: 40 flat models regrouped into 21 archetypes by system family (MAME, RetroArch, Dolphin, Cemu, Switch lineage, PlayStation lines, DOSBox, ScummVM, VICE, WinUAE, per-Nintendo-console groups); every old model kept as a version or in m. Added from fetched pages: OpenEmu is old; DOSBox forks, Eden/Citron/Torzu/Suyu, WinUAE/E-UAE/UAE, ScummVM, VICE. No emulator for Xbox, Mega Drive, Saturn, Dreamcast or DS appears on the fetched list, so none were added. Game mod manager: kept the 5 old models as archetypes, added CurseForge, Modrinth, CKAN, RimSort, Stardrop, Wrye Bash, LOOT, Gale, Zephyr, Prismo from the retrieved itechguides list; Nexus Mods App not covered by tech-insider so itechguides cited. Maker/year left blank where pages do not state them."
